{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29229","headline":"金陵阻风登延祚阁 · 许浑","name":"金陵阻风登延祚阁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"极目皆陈迹，披图问远公。\n戈鋋三国後，冠盖六朝中。\n葛蔓交残垒，芒花没後宫。\n水流箫鼓绝，山在绮罗空。\n极浦千艘聚，高台一径通。\n云移吴岫雨，潮转楚江风。\n登阁慙漂梗，停舟忆断蓬。\n归期与归路，杉桂海门东。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29229.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29229","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}